	'emperor’s second wife.'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'Pamela, raised as royalty, had no immunity to the'
	R
	'beings known as men, and was easily tricked by'
	R
	'Stessel into his captivity.'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'Pamela「Hurry, Stessel...'
	R
	'       Right now is fine...'
	R
	'       Do it like always... Come on...」'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'Stessel「No...'
	R
	'        Teasing gets you more turned on too, doesn’t'
	R
	'        it?」'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'Stessel laughed coldly.'
	R
