	R
	'rightful heir to the throne, out of the country...'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'It was all according to a plan minutely calculated'
	R
	'since well before Sheila was born.'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'As a product of love, he gained the ultimate puppet,'
	R
	'too. The princess believed to be the emperor and'
	R
	'empress’s daughter, Sheila.'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'She was actually born as a result of Stessel and'
	R
	'Pamela’s adultery.'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'Pamela「No... No...'
	R
	'       I can’t wait...'
	R
	'       Please...!」'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'Stessel「...Fine...'
	R
	'        Before that, Pamela...'
	R
	'        Will you listen to my request?」'
