	'       That good-for-nothing...」'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'Stessel「Order Sheila to destroy Patton.」'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'Pamela「But she loves Patton...'
	R
	'       I don’t know if she’d listen...'
	R
	'       Ah... Where are you going?」'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
