	'Pamela「W-Wait!'
	R
	'       I’ll make her listen... So...'
	R
	'       So don’t go!」'
	\L_03c8e:
	ZH 1:
	'When Stessel tried to leave, Pamela followed after'
	R
	'him and seized his hand.'
